> > 
> > >   [ please cc: me on any reply ]
> > > 
> > > I'm seeing lots of problems with the sky2 driver on Mac
> > > Minis. Based on the suggestions in,
> > >     http://www.mail-archive.com/netdev@vger.kernel.org/msg28221.html
